---
title: Tomato Soup
portions: 4
category: Soup
source: "Weeknight staple"
---

## Base ->&soup base

[Sauté] Heat the @olive-oil{2 tbsp} in a #pot{} at ^{medium heat}, then sweat the @onion{1}(diced) and the @garlic{2}(minced) for ~{5 min}.

[Simmer] Add the @tomato{800 g}(canned) and the @vegetable-stock{500 ml}. Simmer ~{20 min}. ->&soup base{}

## Finish

[Blend] Blend the &soup base smooth with an #immersion blender{}.

[Enrich] Stir in the @cream{100 ml} and season with the @salt{1 tsp}.

[Serve] Serve hot, topped with @basil{8} leaves.
